<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>Turtle — HR Policy Assistant</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --bg: #f0f4f8;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --primary: #1a7f6b;
    --primary-light: #e8f5f1;
    --primary-dark: #0e5c4c;
    --text: #1a2332;
    --text-muted: #6b7a8f;
    --bot-msg: #f0f4f8;
    --user-msg: #1a7f6b;
    --user-text: #ffffff;
    --border: #e2e8f0;
    --shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    --radius: 16px;
    --radius-sm: 10px;
    --max-w: 720px;
  }
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .app-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--max-w);
    height: 100vh;
    height: 100dvh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    position: relative;
  }
  header {
    padding: 20px 24px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--card);
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .logo-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    background: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .company-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
  .subtitle { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 400; }
  .welcome-msg {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: var(--primary-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    line-height: 1.5;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
  }
  .chat-area {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }
  .chat-area::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
  .chat-area::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #ccc; border-radius: 4px; }
  .chat-area:empty::after { content: ''; flex: 1; }
  .message {
    max-width: 85%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease;
    word-wrap: break-word;
  }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  .message.bot { align-self: flex-start; background: var(--bot-msg); border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; color: var(--text); }
  .message.user { align-self: flex-end; background: var(--user-msg); border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; color: var(--user-text); }
  .message .msg-label { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 4px; opacity: 0.7; }
  .message.bot .msg-label { color: var(--primary); }
  .message.user .msg-label { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); }
  .message .source-tag { display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
  .message.bot .source-tag.posh { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
  .message.bot .source-tag.leave { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
  .message.bot .source-tag.exit { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
  .message.bot .source-tag.salary { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }
  .message.bot .source-tag.conduct { background: #ede9fe; color: #5b21b6; }
  .message.bot .source-tag.grievance { background: #fce7f3; color: #9d174d; }
  .message.bot .source-tag.fallback { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }
  .input-area { padding: 16px 20px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); flex-shrink: 0; background: var(--card); }
  .input-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-end; }
  .input-row textarea {
    flex: 1; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4; resize: none; outline: none; max-height: 120px; min-height: 48px;
    transition: border 0.15s; background: #fafbfc; color: var(--text);
  }
  .input-row textarea:focus { border-color: var(--primary); background: #fff; }
  .input-row textarea::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .send-btn {
    width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: none;
    background: var(--primary); color: #fff; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
  }
  .send-btn:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }
  .send-btn:active { transform: scale(0.95); }
  .send-btn:disabled { background: #cbd5e1; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }
  .disclaimer { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); flex-shrink: 0; background: #fafbfc; line-height: 1.5; }
  .disclaimer strong { color: var(--text); }
  .typing-indicator { align-self: flex-start; background: var(--bot-msg); padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; display: none; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .typing-indicator.show { display: flex; }
  .typing-indicator span { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: var(--text-muted); border-radius: 50%; animation: typing 1.2s infinite ease-in-out; }
  .typing-indicator span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
  .typing-indicator span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
  @keyframes typing { 0%, 60%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: translateY(0); } 30% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(-4px); } }
  .suggestions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .suggestions button { font-size: 12px; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #fff; color: var(--primary-dark); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; line-height: 1.3; }
  .suggestions button:hover { background: var(--primary-light); border-color: var(--primary); }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    header { padding: 16px 16px 12px; }
    .chat-area { padding: 12px 14px; }
    .message { max-width: 92%; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 14px; }
    .input-area { padding: 12px 14px 16px; }
    .welcome-msg { font-size: 13px; }
    .company-name { font-size: 16px; }
    .suggestions button { font-size: 11px; padding: 6px 12px; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    body { padding: 20px; background: #e6edf4; }
    .app-container { border-radius: var(--radius); height: calc(100vh - 40px); height: calc(100dvh - 40px); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-container">
  <header>
    <div class="logo-row">
      <div class="logo-icon">&#x1F422;</div>
      <div>
        <div class="company-name">Sea Turtle Pvt Ltd</div>
        <div class="subtitle">Turtle — HR Policy Assistant</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="welcome-msg">Hey there! I'm <strong>Turtle</strong>, your HR Policy Assistant. Ask me anything about our <strong>Leave Policy</strong>, <strong>POSH Policy</strong>, <strong>Exit Policy</strong>, <strong>Salary Advance Policy</strong>, <strong>Code of Conduct</strong>, or <strong>Grievance Redressal Policy</strong> — in any language you like!</div>
    <div class="suggestions">
      <button onclick="sendSuggestion(this)">How much annual leave do I get?</button>
      <button onclick="sendSuggestion(this)">What is the POSH policy?</button>
      <button onclick="sendSuggestion(this)">How do I resign from the company?</button>
      <button onclick="sendSuggestion(this)">Can I get a salary advance?</button>
      <button onclick="sendSuggestion(this)">How do I raise a grievance?</button>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="chat-area" id="chatArea" role="log" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="typing-indicator" id="typingIndicator">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="input-area">
    <div class="input-row">
      <textarea id="inputField" placeholder="Type your question here..." rows="1" aria-label="Ask a policy question"></textarea>
      <button class="send-btn" id="sendBtn" aria-label="Send message">&#x2191;</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="disclaimer">For official policy documents or urgent matters, contact HR at <strong>hr@zouk.co.in</strong>.</div>
</div>
